<title>USA: Garan Inc sets regular and special divs.</title>
<headline>Garan Inc sets regular and special divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garan Inc said on Friday it had declared a special dividend of $0.20 per share along with its regular quarterly dividend of $0.20.</p>
<p>Both dividends will be paid November 27 to shareholders of record on November 18.</p>
</text>
